sequenceDiagram
    title COMP-UC11 生成并保存AI行程——组件级顺序图
    actor User as 用户/调用方
    participant Page as AiPlan.vue
    participant API as Axios / Vue Router
    participant Controller as AiController
    participant Service as AiServiceImpl
    participant Dependency as DeepSeek API + AiPlanMapper
    participant Data as MySQL: tm_ai_plan
    User->>Page: 发起“生成并保存AI行程”操作
    Page->>API: POST /api/ai/plan/generate
    API->>Controller: HTTP/JSON + JWT（需要时）
    Controller->>Service: 参数、身份与业务请求
    Service->>Dependency: 执行业务规则/持久化或外部调用
    Dependency->>Data: 查询或条件写入
    alt 成功
      Data-->>Dependency: 返回数据或影响行数
      Dependency-->>Service: 返回业务结果
      Service-->>Controller: 成功结果
      Controller-->>API: Result.success(...)
      API-->>Page: 更新页面状态
      Page-->>User: 展示可验证结果
    else 关键失败
      Note over Service,Data: API Key 缺失、超时或 JSON 非法时使用本地模板并标记降级
      Service-->>Controller: 抛出/返回业务失败
      Controller-->>API: Result.error(...)
      API-->>Page: 展示错误且不伪造成功状态
    end
